          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਡਰਨਾ (ḍarnā) is inherited from Sanskrit darati, \"is frightened\"; CDIAL lists Punjabi ḍarnā, \"to fear\", under it (CDIAL 6190)."
